
GREEK(7)            UNIX Programmer's Manual             GREEK(7)

NAME
     greek - graphics for extended TTY-37 type-box

SYNOPSIS
     cat /usr/public/greek k [ | -Tterminal ]

DESCRIPTION
     _G_r_e_e_k gives the mapping from ascii to the 'shift out' graph-
     ics in effect between SO and SI on model 37 Teletypes with a
     128-character type-box.  These are the default greek charac-
     ters produced by _n_r_o_f_f. The file contains:

     alpha     A   A         beta        B   B         gamma     \   \
     GAMMA     G   G         delta       D   D         DELTA     W   W
     epsilon   S   S         zeta        Q   Q         eta       N   N
     THETA     T   T         theta       O   O         lambda    L   L
     LAMBDA    E   E         mu          M   M         nu        @   @
     xi        X   X         pi          J   J         PI        P   P
     rho       K   K         sigma       Y   Y         SIGMA     R   R
     tau       I   I         phi         U   U         PHI       F   F
     psi       V   V         PSI         H   H         omega     C   C
     OMEGA     Z   Z         nabla       [   [         not       _   -
     partial   ]   ]         integral    ^   ^

FILES
     /usr/public/greek

SEE ALSO
     troff(1)

